Package: prisonerPadAnalysis
Title: Endovascular PAD Outcomes in Incarcerated vs Non-Incarcerated Patients
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Study", "Team", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "study.team@example.org")
Description: Reproducible pipeline that builds a propensity-matched comparison
    group from the VQI PVI registry for a study of endovascular peripheral
    artery disease outcomes in incarcerated versus non-incarcerated patients.
    This DESCRIPTION exists so continuous integration knows which packages to
    install; the project is run as scripts, not loaded as a package.
License: CC0-1.0
Encoding: UTF-8
